<div class="ogrid">
<div class="ol">
<h1 id="ab-h">Md Ashikur Rahman</h1>
<p class="dek">Ashik to most people, Ayon to some. A product builder, debater and reader from Rajshahi, Bangladesh, still working out what he&rsquo;s for.</p>
<p class="stand">This page is the long version: who I am, what I&rsquo;m building, where I&rsquo;ve been and what I believe. If you only have a minute, the &ldquo;At a glance&rdquo; card has the short one.</p>
